      "number": 3,
      "question": "Makaravilakku festival is celebrated at the sacred grove of Lord Ayyappa in:",
      "questionHtml": "Makaravilakku festival is celebrated at the sacred grove of Lord Ayyappa in:",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Telangana",
          "html": "Telangana"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Kerala",
          "html": "Kerala"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Andhra Pradesh",
          "html": "Andhra Pradesh"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Karnataka",
          "html": "Karnataka"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\">The correct answer is&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Kerala</span></u>.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Key Points</u></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<ul style=\"\">\n\t<li>Makaravilakku is an annual festival held on Makar Sankranti in the <strong>Kerala </strong>state.<br />\n\t<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Makaravilakku</span>&nbsp;is an annual festival held on<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;Makara Sankranti</span>&nbsp;at the&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sabarimala Ayyappa</span>&nbsp;temple in&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Kerala.</span>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Makara Jyothi&nbsp;</span>is a star that appears in the sky on Makara Samkramam, when the Sun moves from&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">dhanu Rasi</span>&nbsp;(Sagittarius) to&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Makaram Rasi&nbsp;</span>(Capricorn) on the&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">first day</span>&nbsp;of the<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;Malayalam month</span>&nbsp;of&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Makaram</span>,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">January 14</span>&nbsp;(Makara Sankranti) this year.</li>\n\t\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Onam</span>&nbsp;is the most important and<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;popular festival</span>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Kerala</span>. Celebrated with much<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;pomp</span>&nbsp;and<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;fervor</span>, Onam is a harvest festival.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"\"><span style=\"display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;\">Important festivals:</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 300px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">State</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Festival</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Haryana</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Teej</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Punjab</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Baisakhi</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Andhra Pradesh</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Ugadi</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Arunachal Pradesh</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Pakke Paga Hornbill</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Karnataka</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Kittur</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Assam</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Me-Dam-Me-Phi</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">New Delhi</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">International Mango Festival</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Ladakh</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Losar</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Maharashtra</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Elephanta Festival</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Tamil Nadu</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Aadiperukku</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Telangana</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Bathukamma</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Tripura</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Garia Puja<span style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Mizoram</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Chapchar Kut</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Manipur</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Sangai and Shirui Lily</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n",
