    {
      "id": "ea7a6078b27f-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "In which of the following states is the Bihula festival very popular?",
      "questionHtml": "In which of the following states is the Bihula festival very popular?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Bihar",
          "html": "Bihar"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Madhya Pradesh",
          "html": "Madhya Pradesh"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Odisha",
          "html": "Odisha"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Gujarat",
          "html": "Gujarat"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>The correct answer is&nbsp;<u><strong>Bihar.</strong></u></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Key Points</u></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Bihula festival:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>It is a well-known festival in<strong> eastern Bihar, </strong>especially in the <strong>Bhagalpur district of Bihar</strong>.</li>\n\t<li>Devotees pray to <strong>Goddess Mansa</strong> for the well-being of their families during the festival, which takes place every August.</li>\n\t<li><strong>The festival promotes the brilliant Manjusha art, which is on par with other well-known Bihar folk arts such as Jadopetiya of&nbsp;Santhal Parganas and Madhubani paintings of Mithilanchal.</strong></li>\n\t<li>This festival is held during the month of August each year.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:350px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><strong>State</strong></u></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><strong>Festivals</strong></u></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Odisha</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Chaitra Jatra,&nbsp;Dhanu Jatra,&nbsp;Jagannath Rath Yatra, Turtle Festival,&nbsp;<strong>Nuakhai Festival</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Gujarat</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Bhavnath Fair,&nbsp;Rann Utsav,&nbsp;Shamlaji Fair,<strong>&nbsp;International Kite Festival</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Madhya Pradesh</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Mandu Festival,&nbsp;<strong>Tansen Festival,</strong>&nbsp;Namaste Orchha festival,&nbsp;Khajuraho Dance Festival</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png"
