      "question": "Bhagoria festival is a popular festival in the state of _______.",
      "questionHtml": "Bhagoria festival is a popular festival in the state of _______.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Assam",
          "html": "Assam"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Maharashtra",
          "html": "Maharashtra"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Nagaland",
          "html": "Nagaland"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Madhya Pradesh",
          "html": "Madhya Pradesh"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>The correct answer is <u><strong>Madhya Pradesh</strong></u>.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Key Points</u></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Bhagoria is an important tribal festival of Madhya Pradesh:</span>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>It is celebrated in the month of <strong>March before the Holi festival.</strong></li>\n\t\t<li>During this festival <strong>young boys and girls are allowed to elope after choosing their partners, they are accepted as husband-wife after they mutually agree.&nbsp;</strong></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>About&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Madhya Pradesh:&nbsp;</span>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>State Foundation Day:<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;November 1, 1956</span></li>\n\t\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Capital: Bhopal</span></li>\n\t\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Chief Minis<strong>ter:&nbsp;</strong></span><strong>Mohan Yadav</strong></li>\n\t\t<li><strong><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Governor:&nbsp;</span>Mangubhai C. Patel</strong></li>\n\t\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">State Animal: Barasingha</span></li>\n\t\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">State Bird:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Indian Paradise Flycatcher&nbsp;</span></li>\n\t\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">State Tree:&nbsp;Banyan Tree</span></li>\n\t\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">National Parks: Kanha&nbsp;</span>National Park<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">,&nbsp;Bandhavgarh&nbsp;</span>National Park,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Panna&nbsp;</span>National Park,<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;Satpura&nbsp;</span>National Park<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">,&nbsp;Madhav&nbsp;</span>National Park,&nbsp;Sanjay National Park,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Pench&nbsp;</span>National Park,<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;Van Vihar&nbsp;</span>National Park,&nbsp;Fossil National Park.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
